    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Brady are delighted to bring to the market this detached property set within the highly sought-after Newtown Wood development, this superb two-bedroom, three-bathroom detached home, offers modern, energy-efficient living in an excellent residential location.\n\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, the property boasts an A-rated energy efficiency, providing a comfortable and economical home. The detached layout offers a wonderful sense of privacy, while the property is further enhanced by a large rear and side garden, providing excellent outdoor space for entertaining, relaxing or family life. There is also generous off-street parking with space for two cars.\n\nThe accommodation is well laid out and finished to a high standard, making this an ideal home for first-time buyers, downsizers, or those looking for a modern property with excellent access to local amenities and transport links.\n\nNewtown Wood is ideally positioned close to a wide selection of schools, shops, cafés, restaurants and sporting facilities, with Drogheda town centre just minutes away. The property also benefits from excellent transport connections, with easy access to the M1 motorway and regular rail services, making commuting to Dublin, Belfast and surrounding areas particularly convenient.\n\nThis is a fantastic opportunity to acquire a modern, A-rated detached home in a well-established and desirable development, with the added benefit of a generous private garden."
      },
